{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":443,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Hardcore_Live_Event"},"children":["Hardcore Live Event"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},"\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Hardcore Live Event"]}," was a live event held for the release of the long awaited ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hardcore_Testing_BETA","title":"Hardcore Testing BETA"},"children":["Hardcore Update"]},". However, due to the disastrous launch of that update, it would be turned into a public test for the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Overhaul_v1.0","title":"Overhaul v1.0"},"children":["Overhaul Update"]}," instead."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["It released on the 28th of August 2020, though it was originally meant to release on the 21st of August 2020."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwEg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Live_Event"},"children":["Live Event"]},"\n",{"type":"figure","props":{"id":"mwEw"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwFA"},"children":[]},{"type":"figcaption","props":{},"children":[]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["There was a purple door with an eye in the lobby that had a timer on it. After the timer hit 00:00:00, the live event would start. It began with the screen going black, music changing to ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DIp4Yl69xlA"},"children":["Ticking"]},", with the following text being displayed:"]},"\n",{"typ